  "editorialSummary": "Nothing captures modern progress quite like [Anthropic filing for an IPO](https://oglobo.globo.com/economia/tecnologia/noticia/2026/11/08/anthropic-compra-equipamentos-para-geracao-de-data-centers-de-ia-em-negocio-de-us-34-bi-diz-jornal.ghtml) after logging a modest $114 billion loss while [Binance scrambles to replace billions](https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/east-asia/article/3373627/how-north-korea-turns-child-prodigies-crypto-thieves) lost to fake-interview hackers. At least researchers are testing [a chemogenetic kill switch for epilepsy](https://www.scmp.com/news/china/science/article/3373500/kill-switch-epilepsy-china-cuts-seizures-926-first-human-chemogenetic-trial), which should help humanity cope with whatever financial calamity tomorrow brings.",
